      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: '1010px', padding: '12px 18px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
          零依赖 MCP Server（534 行，stdio）：写状态转发本机服务保证单一写入方，只读能力直读文件
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '14px 18px', background: '#E8EFF8', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
